Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.1 16:9 field: a fifth tile column in 15 slots

With a widescreen gutter over 32 columns the map streamer draws 5 by 3
tiles from the gutter's left edge, and the host has 15 tile slots instead
of 12: (448,0) and (448,128), and (576,0), whose image is loaded in two
64-unit halves one above the other because only a 64-wide strip is left
there; its sprites are remapped (and split across the halves) when drawn.
The camera centers a map too narrow for both gutters. With the gutter at
32 or less the streamer uses only the 12 stock slots, as before.

